  "layout_contract": [
    "MSignatureTrackEvent version3 begins signed32 count and count*16 compact records (signed32 plus six signed16), then a counted fixed-u32-key attribute list. The compact record is not used alone as a recovered map.",
    "Observed top-level value types1/0x801 consume signed64;2/0x22 consume a bounded archive object. High flag semantics are not inferred. Duplicate numeric keys reject. The MTrackVariationCollection bodies remain opaque.",
    "Raw keybytes736b6c43/u32BE0x736b6c43 contain FAttributes version0. Its body uses named typed attributes, with a SignatureEvent type2 compound subtype201 array of one subtype20 class MTimeSignatureEvent in every fixture.",
    "These full signature items are typed attribute compounds with an opaque64 identity and named fields; they are distinct from the compact prefix or packed archive MTimeSignatureEvent reader layout. Identity values are not treated as archive offsets or dereferenced.",
    "Duplicate names reject at every entered named attribute container. Each count and length is bounded, every signature body and entered FAttributes body ends exactly, and unknown object bodies retain declared extents."
  ],
